WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:06.251
Throughout this module we will use a small synthetic
healthcare-style dataset We

00:00:06.277 --> 00:00:11.252
have a patient information table with demographic
and contact fields We have

00:00:11.265 --> 00:00:16.394
a diagnostics table a patient billing table and an
admissions table We

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:20.982
also have a convenience view called patient case
This view brings several

00:00:21.008 --> 00:00:24.822
useful fields together so we can focus on SQL logic
without spending

00:00:24.848 --> 00:00:28.984
all of our time writing joins The data is synthetic
so it

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:32.786
is safe to use for practice When we reach a slide
with

00:00:32.812 --> 00:00:36.678
executable SQL you can run the code directly here in
the browser

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.569
You can also use the Copy button open the Query Tool
in

00:00:40.595 --> 00:00:45.917
pgAdmin paste the query and run it in PostgreSQL
there Using both

00:00:45.943 --> 00:00:47.489
approaches is good practice
